1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"L_P-FSan8ln6Kiybel7Yrw","review_id":"DUJ7p1i4Ew71gWU6Ij8Ilg","date":"2014-03-03T16:18:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9445964097976685,"text_excerpt":"Om nom nom! I had Baru bookmarked for a while and was so happy to get a chance to come here! They easily seated a group of 7 for dinner and kept good service up all night (only small gripe is that they couldn't take more than 4 credit cards from our table, which was hard since people rarely carry a ton of cash around and we racked up a fairly nice sized bill). It is a lot smaller than I thought inside, which adds to the coziness of the place. Would definitely recommend the sangria. I don't normally drink red wine, but the combination they have concocted is delicious. If you like sangria, skip the corkage fee for bringing your own wine and try this! Tapa-wise: - Please, please, please try ..."},{"business_id":"L_P-FSan8ln6Kiybel7Yrw","review_id":"V6_2ERcIH4kdPerNBTsRvQ","date":"2016-07-15T19:02:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9445406198501587,"text_excerpt":"OMG. I've only recently gotten into tapas (I know, I know, but it's saved me a lot of money) and though I doubt this place is authentically Spanish, their food is crazy delicious. We had the happy hour portion of Guacabello (pretty much portobello mushrooms grilled with avocado on 2 tortilla chips), the ceviche, the crab cakes with beet salad, and the pork belly on top of arepas. The pork was my least favorite dish, surprisingly. The mushroom and avocado thing was heaven; soft, buttery avocado and earthy mushroom with oil proved to be a delicious combo. The ceviche juices were really good but I thought the fish had cooked just a liiiittle too much. The crab cakes were perfectly fried and ..."},{"business_id":"L_P-FSan8ln6Kiybel7Yrw","review_id":"JTmkE6EPjg31PRxATmht0g","date":"2009-04-30T14:44:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9434682130813599,"text_excerpt":"We rolled into Baru last week with our local 'tour guide'. Would not have found this place without a local friend in tow. Luckily, we managed to sneak our party of 7 in towards the end of the evening without a wait -- quite a snag as this is a small tapas place with some additional outdoor seating. We mainly went here as they had veggie options to satisfy our party, and tapas with a bit of a local twist. Plus it was BYOB, so we brought some of the wine we picked up upon arriving into town.... Ordered a bunch of tapas to share, and enjoyed the vibe, the company, and the food. We had to order an extra Mazorca, the vegetarian corn dish with shoestring potatoes. Even the non-veggies couldn't ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"L_P-FSan8ln6Kiybel7Yrw","photo_id":"qz2MW5UFMY-QDxjBONLpkg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/qz2MW5UFMY-QDxjBONLpkg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.932140588760376},{"business_id":"L_P-FSan8ln6Kiybel7Yrw","photo_id":"3bgohrKoAbRWXh0YLkNYtQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3bgohrKoAbRWXh0YLkNYtQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8737869262695312},{"business_id":"L_P-FSan8ln6Kiybel7Yrw","photo_id":"2N0Lz1d6jf0RrgCJY1Ei0A","label":"food","image_url":"/pho